  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Water Supply and Sanitation Improvement Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to assist Government to (i) improve access and quality of water supply in target rural communities, (ii) improve sanitation services primarily in schools, and health centres in the selected villages and (iii) strengthen capacity of institutions in the water supply and sanitation sector.</narrative>
  </description>
